    },
    {
      "source": "The order used for this <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/event/EventListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.event\"><code>EventListener</code></a>. Ordering ensures that this\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationListener</code></a> will run before other listeners without a specified priority.",
      "translation": "该顺序用于此<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/event/EventListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.event\"><code>EventListener</code></a>。排序确保此\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationListener</code></a>将在未指定优先级的其他监听器之前运行。",
